# The emblem ("Whenever an artifact is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return that card to the battlefield at
# the beginning of the next end step") on turn 11 (as in the other emblem scenario; loyalty 3, 5, 7, 9, 11). The Lotus Petal Bot1
# sacrifices comes back (the positive control). What does not: Mother of Runes, which Bot2's Bolt kills on turn 12 (not an
# artifact), Bot2's own Lotus Petal, sacrificed on the same turn (it goes to Bot2's graveyard, not "your" graveyard), and a
# Mox Emerald that Bot1 discards with +2 on turn 13 (an artifact, but from the hand, not the battlefield).

